      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but my doctor is super busy and i really can't wait for an appointment just for some knee pain. i've taken ibuprofen before and it was fine. i just want to know if there's a specific amount that's considered safe so i don't overdo it. like, can i take 400mg or 600mg every 6 hours? i'm just trying to manage the pain at home for now.",
